-       The `Openable` instance, `canvasOpenable` in `hallucination.canvas`, is a top-level
-       given and must be imported by name (`import soundness.canvasOpenable`); without it,
-       `open[Canvas]` does not compile, since `Openable` has no fallback. The raster must have
-       a layout in its type (`Raster by Rgba`, which `Raster[Rgba](…)` and `repack[Rgba]`
-       give), so that the handle's pixel type is known.
+       La instancia de `Openable`, `canvasOpenable` en `hallucination.canvas`, es un given de
+       nivel superior y debe importarse por nombre (`import soundness.canvasOpenable`); sin ella,
+       `open[Canvas]` no compila, ya que `Openable` no tiene alternativa. El ráster debe tener una
+       disposición en su tipo (`Raster by Rgba`, que dan `Raster[Rgba](…)` y `repack[Rgba]`), para
+       que se conozca el tipo de píxel del descriptor.

